  "candidate_doc": "Single-token attention specialization.\n\nHypothesis: latency-bound shapes with sequence length one spend unnecessary\nlaunches and GEMM work computing Q, K, softmax attention, and attention masks.\nFor a single token, softmax attention is identically the concatenated V vector,\nso this specialization projects only V, skips SDPA and mask construction, and\npreserves the existing output-projection-as-residual-GEMM path. Invalid tokens\nremain correct because the model's final padding mask zeros their outputs.",
